# QA replay of the grid under the pointer (owner, 2026-10-26: "When you are with the mouse over the map highlight the
# current square and sub-square and show the currently mouse-overed position somewhere where it makes sense"): the mouse
# moved over Streets in Plan and in a raid, as its own moves do. The square under it lit faintly and its ninth a little
# more, the strips' letter and number stronger, and its reference in the readout at the map's top left, the only line out
# of a raid and under YOU's in one; all of it gone as the pointer leaves the map. A developer build plays it with
# --dev-view --dev-script; how to run it, and what each still must show: grid-pointer.md beside this file. Times are in
# seconds.

# A --dev-view session starts on settings of its own, as at a first start, so the tour opened by itself at chapter 1
# once the data was there. It ends first, and leaves its notice at the map's top for 6 s.
tour end
map streets-of-tarkov
wait 1.5

# Plan, the notice still up: the pointer onto the map, a little up and left of its middle. The square lit, the readout's
# line not drawn under the notice.
pointer 0.45 0.45
wait 0.5
snapshot %TEMP%\shturmap-qa\grid-pointer\plan-notice
wait 6
# The notice gone: the readout's line in YOU's place.
snapshot %TEMP%\shturmap-qa\grid-pointer\plan
# Further down and right: another square and ninth, the strips and the readout with them.
pointer 0.6 0.7
wait 0.5
snapshot %TEMP%\shturmap-qa\grid-pointer\plan-moved
# On the readout's corner, left of column A: off the lettered grid, so nothing lit and no line.
pointer 0.07 0.06
wait 0.5
snapshot %TEMP%\shturmap-qa\grid-pointer\plan-off-grid
# Off the map: nothing lit, no readout.
pointer leave
wait 0.5
snapshot %TEMP%\shturmap-qa\grid-pointer\plan-left

# A PMC raid on Streets with a position in D5: YOU's line, and the pointer's under it once the pointer is on the map. The
# raid's cues go first (a still taken while a cue decodes or fades fails to render it).
load
steps
start
wait 3
pos 40 2.5 120 90
wait 6.5
snapshot %TEMP%\shturmap-qa\grid-pointer\raid-you
pointer 0.45 0.45
wait 0.5
snapshot %TEMP%\shturmap-qa\grid-pointer\raid
pointer leave
wait 0.5
snapshot %TEMP%\shturmap-qa\grid-pointer\raid-left
exit
